^END

^ECHO
There are two echos currently available for the discussion of the
products BRE, FE, FH and TAL.

The first is the John Dailey Software support echo, available via
FidoNET (JDSSOFT), TerraNET (JDSSOFT @4701) and WWIVNet (JDSSOFT @4701).

The SRGAMES echo via FidoNET is for the discussion of strictly the
forementioned products.  Discussion of any other John Dailey Software
product should be reserved for the JDS support echo.

If you are a sysop, request JDSSOFT SRGAMES from your Echo
distributor.  If you are a user, look in the message base for either
message area and if it's not there, ask your sysop to pick it up.
^END

^Registered Features
The registered version of Barren Realms Elite offers several enhancements
over the standard version.  These include special bank features such as
investments, interest and loans, and an interplanetary option of SDI
Defense, each adding variety and competitiveness to the game.  If your
sysop is currently running the regular version, we highly recommend you
encourage him or her to get the registered one.  We feel that you will find
it even more enjoyable!

                                           Thanks,
                                           John Dailey

^END
